cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Klein Auto Research in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Klein Auto Research"
abstract: >-
  A process-verifiable research framework for AI for Science: a seven-stage,
  four-gate study lifecycle (consult, data gate, method gate, a notarized
  experiment loop with frontier and registered tracks, insight synthesis with a
  verified claims lock, an independent referee gate, a teaching tutorial) that
  types an inquiry by kind, modality and audience profile, adjudicates
  pre-registered predictions by arithmetic, keeps every discard and crash as
  resolvable evidence, and leaves a git history a stranger can audit with no
  model in the loop.
authors:
